#| msgid "When tracking on a Solar System body, &kstars; will automatically attach an <quote>orbit trail</quote>, showing the path of the body across the sky. You will likely need to change the clock's timestep to a large value (such as <quote>1 day</quote>) to see the trail."
msgid "When tracking on a Solar System body, KStars will automatically attach an “orbit trail”, showing the path of the body across the sky. You will likely need to change the clock's timestep to a large value (such as “1 day”) to see the trail."
